stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> DISCOVERED
  DISCOVERED --> SKIPPED: duplicate or deny-listed
  DISCOVERED --> SCRIPTED: schema valid
  SCRIPTED --> REJECTED: policy fail
  SCRIPTED --> AWAITING_APPROVAL: review needed
  SCRIPTED --> APPROVED: auto-approve
  AWAITING_APPROVAL --> APPROVED: operator OK
  AWAITING_APPROVAL --> EXPIRED: 6 h timeout
  APPROVED --> RENDERING
  RENDERING --> RENDERED: job COMPLETED
  RENDERING --> FAILED: retries exhausted
  RENDERED --> QA_PASSED: spec checks
  RENDERED --> FAILED: QA fail
  QA_PASSED --> PUBLISHING
  PUBLISHING --> PUBLISHED: all LIVE
  PUBLISHING --> PARTIALLY_PUBLISHED: one failed
  PARTIALLY_PUBLISHED --> PUBLISHING: retry
  PUBLISHED --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
